   "In 2015, I sat in front of my computer with a $60 microphone, wondering if anyone would listen to my podcast. Today, I want to share what I've learned from 300+ episodes and 1.8 million downloads..."\
\
2. **Formatting**\
   - Short paragraphs (2-3 sentences)\
   - Clear headings and subheadings\
   - Bullet points for key takeaways\
   - Bold important concepts\
   - Include relevant links\
\
3. **Content Elements**\
   - Personal experiences\
   - Client success stories (anonymized)\
   - Industry insights\
   - Practical tips\
   - Resource recommendations\
\
