2. **Tone Elements**\
   - Intimate and personal\
   - Behind-the-scenes insights\
   - Thoughtful reflections\
   - Community focus\
   - Gratitude expression\
\
3. **Content Mix**\
   - Personal updates (20%)\
   - Teaching/insights (40%)\
   - Resources/recommendations (20%)\
   - Community highlights (20%)\
